# Session AAR documentation (mandatory)

At the end of every decifra-invest-agent agent session (and after automation runs):

1. Write `docs/aar/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md` from `docs/aar/_TEMPLATE.md` with sections:
   - Plan / purpose / objective
   - What actually happened
   - Gaps
   - Lessons
   - Improvements
2. Update `docs/aar/INDEX.md` and append follow-ups to `docs/improvements/LOG.md`.
3. Add useful prompts to `docs/prompts/FUTURE_AGENTS.md` when lessons suggest them.
4. Run `.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe scripts/update_session_dashboard.py`.

Automation traces go under `docs/aar/automation/`. See `docs/workflows/session-closeout.md` and skill `decifra-aar`.
